<h1>Payment &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated: October 30, 2026</strong></p>
<p>This policy explains the general principles that apply when users make payments or use transaction-related features on Trust-Mine.</p>

<h2>Before Making a Payment</h2>
<p>Please review the package or service description, displayed price and applicable conditions before confirming payment. Keep your transaction reference or payment receipt for future queries.</p>

<h2>Payment Records</h2>
<p>Payments should be made only through the payment methods officially displayed or provided by the platform. If a payment is deducted but not reflected in your account, contact support with the transaction reference and relevant proof of payment.</p>

<h2>Refund Requests</h2>
<p>Refund requests will be reviewed according to the service purchased, the status of the transaction and applicable law. Approval is not automatic. Users should provide accurate transaction details when submitting a request.</p>

<h2>Incorrect or Unrecognised Transactions</h2>
<p>If you notice a duplicate, incorrect or unrecognised transaction, contact platform support promptly. Do not share passwords, one-time codes or other confidential security credentials.</p>

<h2>Withdrawals</h2>
<p>Where withdrawal functionality is available, users should review the conditions, eligibility requirements and processing information displayed by the platform. A withdrawal request is subject to account verification and the applicable platform rules.</p>

<h2>Contact and Support</h2>
<p>For payment, refund or transaction questions, use the official support channel available on the Trust-Mine website or within your account. Include relevant transaction details, but never send your password or security codes.</p>

<h2>Policy Changes</h2>
<p>This policy may be updated when platform services or applicable requirements change. The current version will be available on this page.</p>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 Trust-Mine. All rights reserved.</footer>
